</table>
</div>
<div id="S4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For the second case, the link processing times per task <math id="S4.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{ia}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{ia}</annotation></semantics></math> are given by</p>
<table id="S4.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_left_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left"><math id="S4.E3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{bmatrix}0.264&amp;0.291&amp;0.078\\
0.292&amp;0.330&amp;0.084\\
0.104&amp;0.165&amp;0.149\\
\end{bmatrix}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mn>0.264</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.291</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.078</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.292</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.330</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.084</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.104</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.165</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.149</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{bmatrix}0.264&amp;0.291&amp;0.078\\
0.292&amp;0.330&amp;0.084\\
0.104&amp;0.165&amp;0.149\\
\end{bmatrix}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
